	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus et pax Christi.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>28. iunii<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> iunii.</note> abiit <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius</persName> <placeName ref="l18">Augustam</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarer</persName> reiste am 18.(!) Juni nach <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> ab (vgl. oben <ref target="file11324">Nr. 1281</ref>, 72-74), wo er am 27. Juni eintraf (s. <hi>Roth</hi> II 441). Der <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Rat hatte ihn gebeten, an der Befriedung der zerstrittenen Kirche mitzuwirken; s. <hi>Roth</hi> II 440-449.</note> comite domino <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et angelis eius; hunc commendo orationibus tuis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Miserat autem, priusquam abiret, <persName ref="p1365">Grynęo</persName> scriptum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nostrum, quod de conventu <placeName ref="l361">Norimbergensi</placeName> senatui <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nostro obtulimus<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Zum Gutachten der <placeName ref="l257">Konstanzer</placeName> Theologen über das geplante Religionsgespräch s. oben <ref target="file11324">Nr. 1281</ref>, 49-51 mit Anm. 12, und <ref target="file11325">Nr. 1282</ref>, 2-13.</note>.<pb type="edition" next="175"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nunc optimus vir <persName ref="p1365">Grynęus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>scribit ad nos <persName ref="p8055">Blaureros</persName> et <persName ref="p4079">Zviccios</persName> bene longam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>epistolam<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p1365">Grynäus</persName>' Brief an die Gebrüder <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> und <persName ref="p4079">Zwick</persName> ist nicht erhalten.</note>, in qua confutat nostram sententiam, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sed multa synceritate et charitate; meliora <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>enim sperat, quam nos vaticinemur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et nos optamus irritari nostra vaticinia, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>magis vero conventum ipsum irritari optamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Iamque omnino nichil audimus et silent omnia, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sed fiat, quod domino placuerit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Mitto hic tibi libellum <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> Schrift "Von den Konziliis und Kirchen" (<bibl source="b671">WA</bibl> L 488-653); vgl. unten <ref target="file11332">Nr. 1289</ref>, 1-5 sowie <persName ref="p8049">Vadian</persName> BW V 565.</note> apertum et <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>candidum, quem communicabis <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p1753">Leoni</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> et reliquis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Proinde <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>conclusiones quasdam<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Wohl <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> Thesen zur Frage des Widerstands gegen den Kaiser vom April 1539, die u. a. in Basel nachgedruckt wurden (<bibl source="b671">WA</bibl> XXXIX/II 34-51).</note> mitto, sed eas omni<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>no remittendas; non enim meae sunt.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Utinam vero apud vos imprimerentur!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Praeterea haud ita pridem scripsi ad te<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Ein entsprechendes Schreiben ist nicht erhalten.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ut me certiorem faceres, si quis apud vos <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>iuvenis, qui mihi amanuensis loco esse <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>posset quique nonnunquam hypodidascalum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>agere posset in scola.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Neque vero mittendus <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>est statim,<pb type="scan" next="58"/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>sed describendus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ea in re <persName ref="p8127">Pellicani</persName> operam <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>cumprimis desydero; nam ille meum quoque <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ingenium satis novit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Valete omnes in domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>incolumes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Datum 5. iulii 1539.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Tuus <persName ref="p4079">Io. Zvick</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf f. 58a v.:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Domino <pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/><persName ref="p495">Hainricho Bullingero</persName><lb xml:id="p4z2"/>, fratri meo in <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>domino charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
